{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"katatonic-overrated-hairstreak","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Prevention remediation for incident 1c0d (code-review lane)\n\nPost-mortem: `9097-2741-6462-424c`. Origin change `8fbd` (\"Enable class-scoped Anthropic fallback\") passed code review, yet it enabled a fallback whose terminal arm masks a retryable primary. This ticket evaluates a **code-review criterion** that would have flagged it.\n\n### Candidate criterion\nWhen a change adds or edits a fallback chain / provider failover / error-classification path, the reviewer flags: (a) a fallback leg's own failure that can upgrade a retryable primary to non-retryable (disposition-masking), and (b) a failover target that may be unreachable/uncredentialed in a target environment.\n\n### Open decision (BEHAVIOR CHANGE — escalate before implementing)\nAdding an `LLM-Review` criterion alters what the code-review gate blocks/advises on. Needs a go/no-go on: is this a **blocking** or **advisory** criterion; is it a general \"error-handling change\" criterion or narrowly scoped to fallback/classification code; false-positive surface. Do NOT implement until the disposition (scope + blocking level) is decided.\n\n### Acceptance criteria (pending decision)\n- [ ] Decision recorded on criterion scope and blocking level.\n- [ ] If approved: criterion authored + registered; a fixture change reproducing 8fbd's shape is flagged; a benign fallback edit is not.","id":"c180-dadc-7e7e-4ac6","parent_id":"","priority":3,"tags":["prevention","incident-1c0d","llm","code-review","needs-decision"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Prevention (code-review): flag disposition-masking when a change adds/edits a fallback or error-classification path"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788059487483469361,"uuid":"43807914-04be-4c71-a554-a2948cbf9bdb"}